# Prompt Evaluation and Rule Management

1. Buffer prompt in Developer's IDE
2. Process prompts via Cron job (every 15 minutes) for batch processing
3. Extract metadata, deduplicate, and store memory using ChromaDB
4. Evaluate existing rules on stored memory if a matching topic .mdc exists
5. Apply time decay to rule score only when a new memory touches the same topic
